  unitName: Bolt Phoenix Ardas
  unitId: 40095
  unitNumber: 753
  description: The original divine bird which all other types of birds are descended
    from. Since the time when the heavens and the earth were created, this astral
    being has watched over the land from the skies. No human has ever laid eyes upon
    this creature, and only one line in all of mythology actually references it.
    "Storms are born when Ardas flaps its wings, and its cries manifest into thunder
    clouds." Whoever manages to summon this legendary bird will gain the power to
    change the entire world.
  summonDesc: Be amazed! Fear me, Summoner!<br>I have arrived!<br>To be by your side!
  fusionDesc: Were you expecting me?<br>Rejoice, Summoner!<br>For I have risen from
    the flames!
  evoDesc: Remember this, Summoner!<br>I reside in the heart of storms!<br>I surge
    like lightning!
  element: 4
  rarity: 5
